  "contentHtml": "<p>암석을 관찰하고 실감형컨텐츠로 화성암의 생성과정을 보았습니다.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a021b1b7fbd054ee254b3866e4ed0731725c11af\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"358\" height=\"268\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a021b1b7fbd054ee254b3866e4ed0731725c11af\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b551b2613e2f2519c36dd45677e11489bae21dad\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"361\" height=\"271\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b551b2613e2f2519c36dd45677e11489bae21dad\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p>그리고 암석 수행평가를 위해 아이들이 미리 볼수 있도록 과학실 앞에 전시를 해두었는데 반응이 좋았습니다. 테이크아웃 컵의 뚜껑과 택배박스를 활용했습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ba1b94e1487fa80c8f0d29c6d4f400a16ee18159\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"389\" height=\"292\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ba1b94e1487fa80c8f0d29c6d4f400a16ee18159\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f6f1429a25c7263787419416a04f15f6407bd41e\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"398\" height=\"299\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f6f1429a25c7263787419416a04f15f6407bd41e\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f8ac7d793a60feb7403ecdda848b69719d1d27e2\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"403\" height=\"303\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f8ac7d793a60feb7403ecdda848b69719d1d27e2\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p>그리고 광물을 관찰할 때 약통을 활용해서 보니 깔끔하고 좋네요. 뚜껑이 안닫히는 광물도 있어 정리할때는 일부 빼고 놓았지만 학생들이 관찰할 때 이름과 광물이 바로 보여 수업에 활용도가 좋았습니다. 참고하시라고 올려드려요~~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bc6a67ad235fe342408c8ad502b4c124a3e2a42c\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"438\" height=\"329\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bc6a67ad235fe342408c8ad502b4c124a3e2a42c\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4fe2fe3dc5ab21b5e35e46543c2149685ff6fe33\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"444\" height=\"332\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4fe2fe3dc5ab21b5e35e46543c2149685ff6fe33\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
